# Allowlist build context: exclude everything, then re-include only what the
# backend image needs. Secrets (.env, firebase-service-account.json) and the
# frontends can never end up inside the image this way.
*
!backend/app
!backend/requirements.txt
!backend/alembic.ini
!Classifier_Model_training/bert_finetuned

# Belt and braces: even if the allowlist above is loosened later,
# never let these into a build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/firebase-service-account*.json
**/__pycache__
**/celerybeat-schedule*
**/.pytest_cache
